WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.600
Open Settings from the gear in the sidebar. A new account opens it on Add Models.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.900
Local endpoints come first. Paste the address of your local server, here Ollama on the Docker host.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.500
Click Test. CryoZen reports the server is online and lists its models.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.600
Click Add. The endpoint appears under Added Models, and its first model is selected for chat.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.300
Close Settings. qwen3:14b is already selected, and the picker lists every model on the server.
